Package: libttk4
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Tensor ToolKit for diffusion MRI (Inria) - runtime libraries
 TTK (Tensor ToolKit) is an Inria library for processing diffusion tensor
 images: tensor estimation, regularization, tractography and scalar map
 computation, built on the Insight Toolkit (ITK).
 .
 This package provides the shared runtime libraries.

Package: libttk-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libttk4 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libinsighttoolkit5-dev (>= 5.4.6),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Tensor ToolKit for diffusion MRI (Inria) - development files
 TTK (Tensor ToolKit) is an Inria library for processing diffusion tensor
 images built on the Insight Toolkit (ITK).
 .
 This package provides the headers and CMake configuration for building
 against TTK (found via TTK_DIR and the per-component CMake packages).
